# WEB DEMO INPUTS

Copy the values below into the matching fields on the website.

Demo timeline:

```text
Tournament start: July 30, 2026
Tournament end:   July 31, 2026
Primary meeting:  July 31, 2026 - 09:00 AM
Backup meeting:   July 31, 2026 - 10:30 AM
Race time:        July 31, 2026 - 03:00 PM
```

If these times have passed, move all meeting and race times forward together.
An appointment must be in the future and earlier than the race time.

