-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
13. BACKUP JOCKEY TERMS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Horse Owner enters:

```text
Agreed terms
The backup jockey will arrive at least 90 minutes before the race and remain available to replace the primary jockey when officially requested.

Meeting note
Both parties confirmed that this is a standby role and not an active primary riding contract.

Agreed at
07/31/2026 11:00 AM
```

Backup Jockey confirmation:

```text
Response message
I accept the standby terms and confirm my availability as the backup jockey.
```

Expected final status:

```text
Standby Confirmed
```

Do not upload a riding contract for a Backup Jockey.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
14. PRIMARY OR BACKUP CANCELLATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cancellation request:

```text
Reason
The agreed race-day schedule can no longer be fulfilled.
```

Other party approves:

```text
Decision
Approve

Response message
I agree to end the assignment before the race begins.
```

Other party rejects:

```text
Decision
Reject

Response message
I do not agree to cancel the confirmed assignment at this time.
```

Promote Backup to Primary:

```text
Reason
The original primary jockey is unavailable, so the confirmed backup jockey will be promoted to primary.
```

