-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
19. DURING-RACE MAJOR VIOLATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This example visibly adds three seconds to the horse's result.

Select:

```text
Horse
Saigon Thunder

Status
Incident Recorded

Event type
Lane Violation

Severity
Major

Create violation
Checked
```

Incident details:

```text
Time marker
00:00:48

Description
The jockey allowed the horse to leave its lane and interfere with another runner at the second turn.
```

Evidence:

```text
Upload a race camera image or short MP4 video.
```

Expected suggested penalty:

```text
Penalty type
Time Penalty

Penalty value
3 seconds
```

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
20. REFEREE CONFIRMS THE MAJOR PENALTY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

To accept the system suggestion:

```text
Decision
Video review confirms that the jockey committed a major lane violation at the 48-second mark.

Penalty type
Time Penalty

Time penalty
3

Deviation reason
Leave empty because the suggested penalty is being used.
```

To demonstrate a referee adjustment:

```text
Decision
Video review confirms the lane violation.

Penalty type
Time Penalty

Time penalty
2

Deviation reason
The horse was partially forced outward by another runner, so the suggested three-second penalty was reduced to two seconds.
```

Expected calculation:

```text
Raw finish time
72.450 seconds

Penalty
3.000 seconds

Final finish time
75.450 seconds
```

