-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
22. REFEREE REPORT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
Report title
Official Referee Report - Independence Sprint

Report content
The 1200-meter race was completed successfully. At the 48-second mark, Saigon Thunder left its lane and interfered with another runner. The incident was reviewed using race camera evidence.

Race condition
Completed with Confirmed Incident

Weather
Sunny with light wind

Track condition
Dry turf with good grip

Conclusion
One major lane violation was confirmed. A three-second time penalty was applied to Saigon Thunder before the final ranking was calculated.
```

Submit the report after all details have been reviewed.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
23. ADMIN REQUESTS RESULT CORRECTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
Correction note
Please verify the incident time marker and review the camera evidence from the second turn before resubmitting the results.
```

Referee result note after correction:

```text
Result note
The incident time and camera evidence were reviewed again as requested by the administrator.
```

