```

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
25. QUICK DEMO ORDER
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

```text
1. Create Tournament, Round, Race, and Prize.
2. Create Horse and register it for the Race through VNPay.
3. Complete the Primary Jockey appointment, terms, and contract.
4. Complete the Backup Jockey appointment and standby terms.
5. Finalize entries, generate odds, and open betting.
6. Place a Spectator Win bet.
7. Pass all participating horses through pre-race checks.
8. Start the Race.
9. Record one Major Lane Violation for Saigon Thunder.
10. Confirm the suggested three-second penalty.
11. Complete the Race and all post-race checks.
12. Submit the Referee Report.
13. Apply confirmed penalties and submit results for Admin review.
14. Admin confirms and publishes the results.
15. Review final results, prize awards, and settled bets.
```
